---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import caot from '../assets/images/caot.avif';
---
<aside class="about-side-panel" id="aboutPanel" aria-label="About me">
  <button class="panel-close-btn" id="panelClose" aria-label="Close about panel">
    <kbd>esc</kbd>
  </button>
  <div class="panel-content" data-lenis-prevent>
    <h2 class="about-word-mask">About Me (WORK IN PROGRESS)</h2>
    <div class="panel-image-container">
      <Image
        src={caot}
        alt="caot"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        widths={[400, 800]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 400px"
      />
      <span class="image-caption">caot, NOT ralsei</span>
    </div>
    <p class="about-word-mask">
      Hi there! I'm twixxty, a web developer looking for clients (nobody's hiring me bruh TwT).
    </p>
    <p class="about-word-mask">
      I love to enchant websites (with blackmagic) and sometimes make video edits (lost practice but I was good at it. trust me bro).
    </p>
    <div class="panel-banner-container">
      <img
        src="/images/caotbanner.avif"
        alt="banner"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="about-word-mask">here's caot:</p>
    <p class="about-word-mask">he's a goat. a silly little goat. one horn (the right one, the left one just forgot to grow), one eye that's clearly trying harder than the other, and a head that said "F proportions" and meant it.</p>
    <p class="about-word-mask">his ears are long (like really long) and they expand and retract on purpose, he thinks it's funny (it lowkey is).</p>
    <p class="about-word-mask">he smokes a fat blunt and carries a comically large knife and honestly? good for him. no comments.</p>
    <div class="panel-banner-container">
      <img
        src="/images/caotollage.avif"
        alt="caot"
        loading="lazy"
        decoding="async"
        widths={[400, 800]}
        sizes="(max-width: 768px) 80vw, 400px"
      />
    </div>
    <p class="about-word-mask">caot is not perfect. he's better than perfect. he is caot.</p>
  </div>
</aside>
<aside class="about-side-panel contact-side-panel" id="contactPanel" aria-label="Contact form">
  <button class="panel-close-btn" id="contactClose" aria-label="Close contact panel">
    <kbd>esc</kbd>
  </button>
  <div class="panel-content" data-lenis-prevent>
    <h2 class="form-title">drop a message</h2>
    <form
      id="contactForm"
      method="POST"
      name="contact"
      action="https://twixxt.netlify.app/contact"
      class="sidebar-form"
      data-netlify="true"
    >
      <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact" />
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="name">Name</label>
        <input type="text" id="name" name="name" placeholder="Name" required autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="email">Email</label>
        <input type="email" id="email" name="email" placeholder="Email" required />
      </div>
      <div class="form-group">
        <label for="message">Message</label>
        <textarea id="message" name="message" rows="3" placeholder="Message" required></textarea>
      </div>
      <button type="submit" class="faq-btn form-submit-btn">
        <span class="faq-btn-text"><span>Send</span><span>Send</span></span>
        <div class="faq-arrow-box"><span>↗</span><span>↗</span></div>
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>
</aside>
<div class="panel-overlay" id="panelOverlay"></div>